  "plain": "In Varginha, a town in Brazil, on 20 January 1996, a strange creature was reportedly seen, and this story is one part of that case. James Fox, a UFO investigator, says that near a military roadblock, three young girls named Valquiria, Liliane and Katia had \"an encounter of the third kind,\" meaning they came face to face with a being. A podcast host, Jesse Michels, adds that the girls are grown women now and all still say they saw it. If true, a living non-human creature was walking around a Brazilian town."
